  "officialHtml": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/jus600.html",
  "prefLabel": "Jus 602.15 Domicile",
  "priorExpiration": "2017-09-25",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Jus 602.15 “Domicile” means that one place where a person, more than any other place, has established a physical presence and manifests an intent to maintain a single continuous presence for domestic, social, and civil purposes relevant to participating in democratic self-government.\n\nSource. #9553, eff 9-25-09, EXPIRED: 9-25-17\n\nNew. #12938, eff 12-9-19 (formerly Jus 602.13)",
